__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"default",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return h}});var o=r(d[0]),t=r(d[1]),n=r(d[2]),s=r(d[3]);function h(){const h=(0,o.c)(6);let u,c,l,y,p,f;return h[0]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(u={title:"Your Location",body:["OnMyLead only shares your location when you turn sharing on, for a ride or with people you pick, and only for the time you choose. Sharing stops when the timer runs out, when the ride ends or when you stop it. The rules are enforced by our database, not just the app.","Your exact location is never shown publicly. Public rides show a rounded meeting area; the exact meeting point is only for riders who join.","While a ride is live, the app keeps sharing with the phone locked so your group can see you. If you make a family link, anyone with that link can see your location until the share ends.","Your own ride track is kept so you can see your ride summary. The group summary only shows totals, never anyone\u2019s route."]},h[0]=u):u=h[0],h[1]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(c={title:"What We Collect",body:["Account: your email address and password (stored securely by our sign-in provider), and the ride name you pick. If you sign in with Apple, Google or Facebook, that service tells us your email address and, except for Apple, the name and profile photo on your account. We never get your password for those services or anything you post there.","What you add: rides, routes, waypoints, Garage machines and photos, trip checklists, Starlink setup, riding groups, ride chat messages and poll votes. Waypoints you drop are only yours unless the ride\u2019s leader shares them with the riders on that ride.","Device and app: a push notification token and your notification settings, crash reports (through Sentry) and basic usage events, such as a ride being created, so we can fix problems and improve the app. Crash reports never include your location.","Purchases: if you buy Pro, Apple sends us the subscription\u2019s status and transaction details. We never see your card or payment details.","Safety agreement: when you agree to the Rider Safety and Liability Agreement, we save a record of it: your account, email address and ride name, which version you agreed to and a fingerprint of its exact text, the time, the app version, the kind of device and its system version, language, IP address and browser. It is never shown to other riders.","Leaderboard: if you pick where you ride from, we save your country and, in some countries, your state or province (just those, never a place). If you tap Use My Location to fill it in, your phone works out the country and state itself and only those two are sent.","Website: onmylead.com uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts visits without cookies.","Music Controls: to show what\u2019s playing and let you pause, skip and change the volume, the app reads the current song, artist and music app on your phone. It never leaves your phone. On Android, the optional Notification Access you can allow for this is used only to see what\u2019s playing; the app never reads or keeps your notifications."]},h[1]=c):c=h[1],h[2]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(l={title:"Who We Share It With",body:["We do not sell your data or use it for advertising. We share it only with the services that run OnMyLead: Supabase (database and sign-in), Apple (push notifications and purchases on iPhone and iPad), Google (push notifications through Firebase Cloud Messaging and purchases through Google Play on Android), Sentry (crash reports), Resend (emails such as ride cancellations) and Cloudflare (the website). If you look up a VIN in your Garage, that VIN is sent to the US government\u2019s free NHTSA lookup. When you search for a park, trailhead or town, only the words you type and a rough map area go to Photon, an OpenStreetMap place search; trail maps are loaded from OpenFreeMap. Neither is told who you are. When you tap Navigate or Directions, the destination opens in Apple Maps or Google Maps, and their own privacy policies apply there. On Android the map itself is drawn by Google Maps, which Google\u2019s privacy policy covers.","Reports: the OnMyLead team doesn\u2019t read your direct messages or chats. When a rider reports another rider, the messages between those two riders (their direct messages, and what either wrote in the last 30 days in a riding group or ride chat they share) are saved with the report so the team can look into it, and kept while the report is needed. Only the OnMyLead team can read them, every viewing is logged, and the rider reported isn\u2019t told who reported them.","Other riders see what you share with them: your ride name, the rides you join, your messages on those rides and, while you share, your location. If you turn on Show My Google (or Apple or Facebook) Profile, riders you share a ride or riding group with also see that account\u2019s name and photo. It\u2019s off until you turn it on, and you can turn it off any time on the You tab.","Signed-in riders can see the badge leaderboard: your ride name, picture, badges and the state or country you picked. Turn off Show Me on the Leaderboard to leave it. If your Feed activity is set to Nobody, you\u2019re left off until you turn it on.","We may disclose information if the law requires it."]},h[2]=l):l=h[2],h[3]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(y={title:"Your Choices",body:["You can stop sharing your location at any time, change notification settings in Profile, and turn off location or notifications in your phone\u2019s settings.","You can delete your account from You > Delete Account. Your account, the rides you organize, your Garage, trips, groups and location history are deleted right away. We keep the record of your safety agreement, because it is a legal record of what you agreed to.",`Email ${n.SUPPORT_EMAIL} to ask for a copy of your data or to ask any privacy question.`]},h[3]=y):y=h[3],h[4]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(p={title:"Children",body:["OnMyLead is not meant for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information."]},h[4]=p):p=h[4],h[5]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(f=(0,s.jsx)(t.LegalPage,{title:"Privacy Policy",updated:"November 3, 2026",intro:`OnMyLead is made by ${n.COMPANY}. This page explains what the app and onmylead.com collect, why, and the choices you have. The short version: your location is never public, you choose who sees it, and sharing always ends.`,sections:[u,c,l,y,p,{title:"Changes and Contact",body:["We will post any change here and tell you in the app if it matters.",`${n.COMPANY}. Questions about your data, or a request to see or delete it: ${n.SUPPORT_EMAIL}.`]}]}),h[5]=f):f=h[5],f}},1962,[11,1963,904,6]);
